//@version=6
// Range Finder [Kalman] v5.6 — Selectable HTF Structure + Chart-TF Reaction
//
// v5.6 changes the MTF architecture:
//   • Structure Timeframe is now an explicit input (e.g. 60 = 1H).
//   • You can keep the TradingView chart on 1m/3m/5m/etc.
//   • Range detection, breakout confirmation, profile, pullback candidate ranking,
//     and adaptive candidate history are calculated from CONFIRMED structure-TF bars.
//   • The chart timeframe is used only to judge the live retest/rejection/acceptance.
//   • HTF data uses the non-repainting request.security(..., expression[1],
//     lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on) pattern.
//   • A wick through the hard invalidation is allowed. A CLOSED chart-TF candle
//     through the hard invalidation kills the entry setup.
//
// Research-informed pullback candidates remain:
//   1. broken range edge / SR flip
//   2. nearest Forex round number
//   3. prior value-area edge
//   4. prior range POC
//
// CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
